      "roleName": "Vice President Marketing",
      "name": "Vice President Marketing, Happay",
      "startDate": "2019-11",
      "endDate": "2022-01",
      "description": "Vice President Marketing, Happay. Responsible for twin growth engines of Inbound and Outbound Marketing, ABM, Sales enablement and Inside Sales function. 161% ARR growth. +178% Enterprise deal size increase. 65-72% Marketing-sourced pipeline. Happay was named among the fastest growing technology companies in Deloitte Technology Fast 50 India 2020. 2x exit: to CRED ($180M), then MakeMyTrip."
    },
