      "startDate": "2016-07",
      "endDate": "2017-10",
      "description": "Director of Product Marketing, Seclore. Overall marketing strategy including messaging, positioning, definition and execution of product marketing programs, and PR for the Middle East and India. 165% revenue growth. Rs 2.35 Cr TCV in 6 months through Account-Based Marketing. 85%+ of regional sales pipeline and revenue. 225+ sales meetings for target accounts. ABM model for 70+ enterprises. Built and managed a marketing team of 7 with a Rs 1.5 Cr annual budget. 74+ content pieces. Gartner Market Guide coverage through an analyst program. 5 additional analyst mentions. Frost & Sullivan award through the analyst relations program."
    },
